      "value": "@{6123c931f969824ae5de23e3|full_name}: is the clothing file an fbx you made or from somewhere else? What if you import into blender and re export with no changes? Or maybe character is one fbx that you exported.\n\nAlso what shaders? If there are any material you haven't made, maybe remake.\n\nIt shouldn't be that easy to make an avatar mess up the menu like that. From yesterday's patch notes video the key sequence is Ctrl and \\ to reset avatar. They fixed a bug where you could apparently reset your avatar with a text input up on the screen.\n\nMy guess would be material/shader. Well, shader but you'd be replacing materials to all use different shader.",
