  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I tried to upload a new version of my avatar, did the same I did before with every avatar I uploaded and when I tried to change into the new avatar VRChat broke. You can see it a bit in the picture. I could only see the skybox of my home world and fractions of the menu, but had no possibility to click anything. I was also not able to log off or anything via the menu. I had to close VRChat with the task manager.\n\nDid anyone ever had this happening before? Does anyone know how I can fix it? Or is it a VRChat problem, I cannot do anything against?",
